---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Turathi Octagon | Turathi"
  description="How I honour the places that keep their heritage alive."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-24">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">The Turathi Octagon</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-navy">The Turathi Octagon</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-navy/70 max-w-2xl">
      The Turathi Octagon is how I honour the places that kept their heritage
      alive, in their food, their form and the way they treat a guest. Tradition
      isn't nostalgia. It's the better answer we stopped using.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-navy/50 max-w-2xl">
      The tiers and how to take part are still being finalised (placeholder).
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
